{
  "key": "solaredge",
  "label": "SolarEdge (Modbus TCP)",
  "source": "Loxone Library template SolarEdge Inverter (solaredge-inverter-127 v3.0.3) + SolarEdge power control",
  "values": "loxone",
  "notes": [
    "Raw values with a scale factor (X_RAW + X_SF): value = RAW × 10^SF; LoxSuite does that when both are linked.",
    "Power control: three outputs a user adds in Loxone — Active Power Limit (0–100 %), AdvancedPwrControlEn (0 = off, 4 = active) and ReactivePwrConfig (0 = off, 1 = active). LoxSuite puts the two enables on once and leaves them on (they are stored in the inverter); the limit alone does the work, 100 % = no limit."
  ],
  "registers": [
    {
      "reg": 40100,
      "label": "I_DC_Power_RAW",
      "comment": "DC Power Raw",
      "rw": "r",
      "unit": null,
      "scale": 1,
      "key": "i_dc_power_raw",
      "sf": "i_dc_power_sf",
      "role": "dcPower",
      "div": 1000
    },
    {
      "reg": 40101,
      "label": "I_DC_Power_SF",
      "comment": "DC Power Scaling Factor",
      "rw": "r",
      "unit": "x",
      "scale": 1,
      "key": "i_dc_power_sf"
    },
    {
      "reg": 40107,
      "label": "I_Status",
      "comment": "Inverter Status",
      "rw": "r",
      "unit": null,
      "scale": 1,
      "key": "i_status",
      "role": "status",
      "map": {
        "1": "Uit",
        "2": "Slaapstand (nacht)",
        "3": "Opstarten",
        "4": "Produceert",
        "5": "Produceert (begrensd)",
        "6": "Afschakelen",
        "7": "Storing",
        "8": "Onderhoud"
      }
    },
    {
      "reg": 40206,
      "label": "M_AC_Power_RAW",
      "comment": "Grid Power Raw",
      "rw": "r",
      "unit": null,
